 "_about": {
  "what": "Per monster, the ROM Monster Levels (cQuestData mMonsterLv) of the real quests it is fought in, as {level: quest count}. 0 Village Low, 1 Low, 3 High, 5 G -- the ROM's own values, named by cOtQuestExpBias. The deflect floor is 0.27 at level 5 and 0.25 otherwise (0x177bc4 / 0x17443c via 0x3a8430), so a monster whose only level is 5 always uses 0.27.",
  "source": "loc/quest/questData/*.ext (one packed cQuestData each), filtered to the quests rQuestGroup (quest/quest_group in loc/arc/village/common.arc) lists and the ROM text does not title as a placeholder: 1479 quests.",
  "village": "Village Advanced quests split: the 6-star set (622-641) is level 3, the 10-star set (1009-1055) is level 5. No other village quest is 5.",
